# Add files here to ignore them from prettier formatting
/dist
/coverage
/.nx/cache
/.nx/workspace-data
.nx/self-healing

# Prose is written and reviewed by hand. Prettier's markdown printer pads every
# table cell to the width of its column, rewrites `*emphasis*` as `_emphasis_`
# and reflows paragraphs — so a one-line edit to PLAN.md came out as a
# 1,175-line diff, and every other markdown file in the repo was the same.
#
# None of it had ever been formatted, which made the whole class invisible:
# `nx format:check --base` only looks at files a change touches, so markdown
# passed CI by never being edited. The first documentation change to land would
# have failed the build for reasons having nothing to do with the change.
*.md
*.mdx
